[00:00.000] 作词 : アトラスサウンドチーム
[00:00.994] 作曲 : アトラスサウンドチーム
[00:01.988] Another wander in the night (又一次漫步于夜色)
[00:05.452] Let me paint the view (让我来描绘这风景)
[00:07.667] Colour the town with my light (用我的光点亮这色彩)
[00:12.003] For every moment shared with you (为与你分享的每一刻)
[00:13.851] Not out in the day (虽已不在白昼)
[00:16.555] You never fully gone (但也并未消逝)
[00:19.339] Going to be back again (总会再次回归)
[00:23.315] Until the coming of a dawn (在曙光降临的时刻)
[00:50.046] Two hands meet at zenith (我们的双手在空中交错)
[00:52.838] Nothing comes between us (没有什么能够阻挡我们)
[00:55.587] Dancing like ballerinas (如同芭蕾舞者一样)
[00:58.189] Under the moon light all night long (在月光下翩翩起舞)
[01:01.197] How these plain and simple scenes (那些平淡无奇的景色)
[01:03.726] Get painted so vividly by you... (被你描绘的如此生动)
[01:10.149] I just want to stay with you (我只想和你在一起)
[01:11.934] Around the world I slowly dance (在世界里轻轻摇曳)
[01:15.069] Whenever our eyes meet (我们目光交汇之时)
[01:17.541] You know you leave me in a trance (你知道会让我恍惚)
[01:21.741] It means everything to me (对我而言这就是一切)
[01:23.405] Looking down below (往下看去)
[01:26.326] The one I seek to find (我寻觅的那个人)
[01:28.925] No matter where you might go (无论你会去往何方)
[01:32.886] Remember you'll be on my mind (记住你永远在我心中)
[01:56.597] Within the inner heart I plead (我心中仍抱有期望)
[01:59.861] For you to talk to me (或许能再听你讲讲)
[02:02.213] I want to hear all the good and bad (我想再听听那些所有好的和不好的)
[02:05.503] The new stories you have (那些你新的故事)
[02:07.829] As I drift across the sky (当我飘散在天空)
[02:11.029] The hour hand turns high (当时钟高高转动)
[02:14.109] So goodnight (该说晚安了)
[02:16.813] Let me sing a lullaby, (让我唱首摇篮曲)
[02:25.064] I'll be singing, baby (再见，宝贝)